  MLI:{fr:["Tombouctou fut un grand centre de savoir médiéval.","La grande mosquée de Djenné est le plus grand bâtiment en terre crue du monde.","Le fleuve Niger y forme un immense delta intérieur."],en:["Timbuktu was a great medieval center of learning.","The Great Mosque of Djenné is the world's largest mud-brick building.","The Niger River forms a huge inland delta here."]},
